1. Project Overview
App Name
AniPals

2. Project Description
AniPals is a web-based multiplayer pixel-art farming simulation game where players manage a community of autonomous animal companions called “AniPals.”

Unlike traditional farming games where players manually perform repetitive tasks, AniPals focuses on strategic management. AniPals automatically perform farming, gathering, and production tasks while players focus on progression, optimization, collection, and multiplayer interaction.

The game combines:
Idle progression systems
Real-time multiplayer interactions
Pet collection mechanics
Farming simulation
Competitive and cooperative gameplay
Interactive mini-games

Players can:
Build and manage farms
Collect AniPals through a gacha system
Upgrade and optimize AniPals
Trade items and AniPals
Visit other players’ farms
Send gifts
Participate in raids
Progress even while offline

