14. Recommended OOP Design
---
SOLID Principles
Single Responsibility
Each service handles one domain only.

Example:
GachaService only handles pulls.

---

Open/Closed
Weather effects extend through strategies.
---
Dependency Inversion
Controllers depend on interfaces.
—
GRASP Principles
Controller
Controllers handle API entry only.
---
Information Expert
Farm entity handles farm state.
---
Low Coupling
Trading isolated from farming.
---
High Cohesion
Each module owns one responsibility.
