17. MVP User Flows
---
FLOW 1 — New Player Onboarding
Goal
Get player into gameplay quickly.
Steps
1. User registers account
2. User logs in
3. User creates username
4. Tutorial automatically starts
5. User performs tutorial gacha pull
6. User receives starter AniPal
7. User plants first crop
8. Tutorial completes
9. User enters main gameplay loop
---

FLOW 2 — Core Gameplay Loop
Goal
Establish repeatable gameplay cycle.
Steps
1. Player logs in
2. Collects offline rewards
3. Checks farm status
4. AniPals harvest crops
5. Player collects resources
6. Player upgrades inventory/resources
7. Player plays mini-games
8. Earns gacha currency
9. Performs gacha pulls
10. Obtains stronger AniPals
11. Improves farming efficiency
12. Repeats cycle
---

FLOW 3 — Gacha Pull Flow
Steps
1. Player opens banner
2. Player selects pull count
3. Backend validates currency
4. Pity counter checked
5. Rewards generated
6. Inventory updated
7. Pull animation shown
8. Results displayed
9. Pity updated

---
FLOW 4 — Trading Flow
Steps
1. Player searches UID
2. Sends trade request
3. Other player accepts
4. Trade room opens
5. Both players add items
6. Both confirm
7. Backend validates ownership
8. Trade executes atomically
9. Trade success notification shown

---
FLOW 5 — Offline Progression Flow
Steps
1. Player exits game
2. Server records timestamp
3. AniPals continue simulated work
4. Player returns
5. Backend calculates elapsed time
6. Rewards generated
7. Summary popup displayed

---
FLOW 6 — Weather Event Flow
Steps
1. Global weather rotates
2. Weather notification appears
3. Farm visuals update
4. Gameplay modifiers activate
5. Special drops become available

